# Public, non-secret — the spCoin web app's real production URL.
# Tracked in git deliberately, same reasoning as the main
# spcoin-nextjs-front-end repo's own .env.production: this is a public
# build-time value, not a credential. Vite loads this automatically for
# `npm run build` (mode defaults to "production").
#
# No .env/.env.local counterpart is committed for local dev — .gitignore
# already excludes those, and src/config.ts falls back to
# http://localhost:3000 when VITE_APP_URL isn't set, so dev works with
# zero local config out of the box. Add a local .env only if you need to
# point dev builds somewhere other than localhost:3000.
VITE_APP_URL=https://sponsorcoin.org
